# man pages for Viua VM

Use the following command to render and view them without installation:

    ]$ bash ./see-scdoc.sh man1/viua.1.scdoc | less -R

After installation, the man pages are available by invoking each tool with the
--help option, invoking the frontend's help subcommand with a tool's name, or by
requesting the man page directly eg,

    ]$ viua asm --help
    ]$ viua help asm
    ]$ man 1 viua-asm
